        "But they boldly went up toward the top of the hill anyway. Still, neither Moses nor the ark of the Lord’s covenant left the camp.",
        "Then the Amalekites and the Canaanites who lived in that hill country came down and attacked them. They beat them and chased them all the way to Hormah."
