        "Six of the towns you give the Levites will be cities of refuge (safe places). You will set them apart so that a person who has killed someone can run there for safety. Besides these, give them forty-two more towns.",
        "In all, you will give the Levites forty-eight towns, along with their pasturelands.",
        "These towns will come from the land the Israelites own. Take more towns from a tribe that has a lot of land, and fewer from a tribe that has little. Each tribe will give some of its towns to the Levites, in proportion to the land it receives.",
