        "Or if someone hits a person with a wooden weapon in his hand that can kill, and the person dies, he is a murderer. The murderer must be put to death.",
        "The avenger of blood (the dead person’s relative) is the one who will put the murderer to death. When he finds him, he will kill him.",
        "If someone pushes a person out of hatred, or lies in wait and throws something at him, and the person dies,",
