        "Today I call heaven and earth as witnesses against you that I have set in front of you life and death, blessing and curse. So choose life, so that you and your children may live.",
        "Love the Lord your God, obey His voice, and hold tight to Him. He is your life and the length of your days. Then you can live in the land the Lord promised with an oath to give to your fathers, to Abraham, to Isaac, and to Jacob."
