        "“Gather the people together, men, women, and children, and the foreigners living in your towns, so they can listen and learn to fear the Lord your God and carefully obey all the words of this law.”",
        "“Then their children, who do not yet know it, will hear and learn to fear the Lord your God for as long as you live in the land you are crossing the Jordan to take over.”",
        "The Lord said to Moses, “The time is near for you to die. Call Joshua, and both of you come stand at the tent of meeting, so I can give him his charge.” So Moses and Joshua went and stood at the tent of meeting.",
        "The Lord appeared at the tent in a pillar of cloud, and the pillar of cloud stood over the tent’s doorway.",
        "The Lord said to Moses, “Soon you will die and rest with your fathers. Then these people will rise up and be unfaithful to Me like a prostitute, chasing after the foreign gods of the land they are going into. They will leave Me and break My covenant that I made with them.”",
        "“On that day My anger will burn against them. I will leave them and hide My face from them, and they will be eaten up. Many disasters and troubles will come on them, so that on that day they will say, ‘Haven’t these disasters come on us because our God is not with us?’”",
        "“I will certainly hide My face on that day because of all the evil they have done by turning to other gods.”",
        "“So now write down this song for yourselves and teach it to the children of Israel. Have them learn it by heart, so this song can be My witness against the children of Israel.”",
        "“When I have brought them into the land I promised their fathers with an oath, a land flowing with milk and honey, and they have eaten all they want and grown fat, they will turn to other gods and serve them. They will treat Me with contempt and break My covenant.”",
        "“When many disasters and troubles have come on them, this song will testify against them like a witness, because their descendants will not forget it. For I know what they are planning even now, before I have brought them into the land I promised with an oath.”",
        "So that same day Moses wrote down this song and taught it to the children of Israel.",
        "Then He gave Joshua son of Nun his charge and said, “Be strong and brave, for you will bring the children of Israel into the land I promised them with an oath, and I will be with you.”",
        "When Moses had finished writing the words of this law in a book, all the way to the end,",
        "Moses gave this command to the Levites who carried the ark of the covenant of the Lord:",
        "“Take this book of the law and put it beside the ark of the covenant of the Lord your God, so it can stay there as a witness against you.”",
        "“I know how rebellious and stubborn you are. Look, even now, while I am still alive with you, you have rebelled against the Lord. How much more will you rebel after I die!”",
