        "He said: The Lord came from Sinai and rose like the sun on them from Seir. He shone out from Mount Paran and came with ten thousands of holy ones. From His right hand came a fiery law for them.",
        "Yes, He loves the people. All His holy ones are in Your hand. They sit down at Your feet, and each one receives Your words.",
        "Moses gave us a law, the inheritance of the gathered people of Jacob.",
        "And He was King in Jeshurun (Israel) when the leaders of the people and the tribes of Israel came together.",
        "Let Reuben live and not die, and don’t let his men be few.",
        "This is the blessing for Judah. He said, “Lord, hear Judah’s cry and bring him back to his people. Let his own hands be strong enough for him, and be his help against his enemies.”",
        "About Levi he said: Let Your Thummim and Your Urim (sacred objects used to learn God’s will) be with Your faithful one, whom You tested at Massah and argued with at the waters of Meribah.",
        "Levi said of his father and his mother, “I have not seen him.” He did not recognize his brothers or claim his own children, for they obeyed Your word and kept Your covenant.",
        "They will teach Your rulings to Jacob and Your law to Israel. They will set incense before You and whole burnt offerings on Your altar.",
        "Lord, bless all he owns, and be pleased with the work of his hands. Crush the backs of those who rise up against him and of those who hate him, so they never get up again.",
        "About Benjamin he said: The one the Lord loves will live safely beside Him. The Lord covers him all day long, and he rests between His shoulders.",
        "About Joseph he said: May the Lord bless his land with the best gifts of heaven, with the dew, and with the deep waters that lie underneath,",
        "with the best crops the sun brings out, and the best things the moon brings out month by month,",
        "with the finest things of the ancient mountains, and the precious things of the hills that last forever,",
        "with the best gifts of the earth and everything in it, and with the favor of Him who lived in the bush (the burning bush). Let the blessing rest on the head of Joseph, on the head of the one who was set apart from his brothers.",
        "His glory is like a firstborn bull, and his horns are like the horns of a wild ox. With them he will drive the nations together, all the way to the ends of the earth. These are the ten thousands of Ephraim, and these are the thousands of Manasseh.",
        "About Zebulun he said: Be glad, Zebulun, when you go out, and Issachar, in your tents.",
        "They will call peoples to the mountain, and there they will offer sacrifices that are right. For they will draw riches from the seas and treasures hidden in the sand.",
        "About Gad he said: Blessed is the one who makes Gad’s land bigger! Gad lives like a lion and tears off an arm, even the top of a head.",
        "He chose the best part for himself, because a leader’s share was kept for him there. He came with the heads of the people. He carried out the Lord’s justice and His rulings for Israel.",
        "About Dan he said: Dan is a young lion that will leap out from Bashan.",
        "About Naphtali he said: Naphtali, you are filled with favor and full of the Lord’s blessing. Take the west and the south as your own.",
        "About Asher he said: May Asher be blessed with children. May his brothers be pleased with him, and may he dip his foot in oil (have plenty of olive oil).",
