        "So Israel will live in safety, all alone. The spring of Jacob will be in a land of grain and wine, where the skies drip down dew.",
        "How happy you are, Israel! Who is like you, a people saved by the Lord? He is the shield that helps you and the sword that makes you great. Your enemies will come cringing to you with lies, and you will walk on their high places."
