        "The things you see will drive you insane.",
        "The Lord will strike your knees and legs with painful boils that cannot be healed, covering you from the soles of your feet to the top of your head.",
        "The Lord will take you and the king you put over yourselves to a nation that neither you nor your fathers have known. There you will serve other gods made of wood and stone.",
        "You will become a horror, an example people talk about, and a name they mock, among all the nations where the Lord will drive you.",
        "You will take a lot of seed out to the field but bring in only a small harvest, because locusts will eat it up.",
        "You will plant vineyards and take care of them, but you won’t drink the wine or gather the grapes, because worms will eat them.",
        "You will have olive trees all through your land, but you won’t anoint yourself with their oil, because your olives will drop off.",
        "You will have sons and daughters, but you won’t get to keep them, because they will be taken away as captives.",
        "Locusts will take over all your trees and the crops of your land.",
        "The foreigner living in your land will climb higher and higher above you, while you fall lower and lower.",
        "He will be the one lending to you, not you to him. He will be the head, and you will be the tail.",
        "All these curses will come on you. They will chase you and catch you until you are destroyed, because you did not listen to the voice of the Lord your God and keep the commandments and laws He gave you.",
        "They will be a sign and a wonder on you and on your descendants forever.",
        "You did not serve the Lord your God with joy and a glad heart when you had plenty of everything.",
        "So you will serve the enemies the Lord sends against you, while you are hungry, thirsty, without clothes, and lacking everything. He will put an iron yoke on your neck until He has destroyed you.",
        "The Lord will bring a nation against you from far away, from the ends of the earth, swooping down like an eagle, a nation whose language you won’t understand,",
        "a fierce-looking nation that will have no respect for the old and no pity for the young.",
        "They will eat your young animals and your crops until you are destroyed. They will leave you no grain, wine, or olive oil, no calves from your cattle or lambs from your flocks, until they have wiped you out.",
        "They will surround and attack all your cities throughout your land, until the high, strong walls you trusted in fall down. They will lay siege to every city in all the land the Lord your God has given you.",
        "In the siege and the desperate trouble your enemies will bring on you, you will eat your own children, the flesh of the sons and daughters the Lord your God has given you.",
        "Even the most gentle and refined man among you will look with hard, stingy eyes at his own brother, at the wife he holds close, and at the children he still has left,",
        "and he will not give any of them a bite of his children’s flesh that he is eating, because he has nothing else left in the siege and the desperate trouble your enemies will bring on you in all your cities.",
        "The most gentle and refined woman among you, so delicate and pampered she would never even try to set her foot on the ground, will look with hard, stingy eyes at the husband she holds close, and at her son and her daughter,",
        "and at the afterbirth that comes out of her body, and at the children she gives birth to. For she will eat them in secret, because she has nothing at all, in the siege and the desperate trouble your enemies will bring on you in your cities.",
        "If you are not careful to obey all the words of this law that are written in this book, and to fear this glorious and awesome name, the Lord your God,",
