        "The Lord will also bring on you every sickness and every plague that is not written in the book of this law, until you are destroyed.",
        "Though you were once as many as the stars in the sky, only a few of you will be left, because you would not obey the voice of the Lord your God.",
        "Just as the Lord was glad to do good to you and make you many, so the Lord will be glad to destroy you and bring you to nothing. You will be torn off the land you are going in to take over.",
        "The Lord will scatter you among all peoples, from one end of the earth to the other. There you will serve other gods of wood and stone, gods that neither you nor your fathers have known.",
        "Among those nations you will find no peace, and no place to rest your feet. There the Lord will give you a shaking heart, eyes worn out with longing, and a grieving mind.",
