        "So Joshua commanded the priests, “Come up out of the Jordan.”",
        "The priests carrying the ark of the covenant of the Lord came up out of the middle of the Jordan. As soon as the soles of their feet stepped up onto dry land, the water of the Jordan went back to its place and overflowed all its banks as it had before.",
        "The people came up out of the Jordan on the tenth day of the first month. They set up camp at Gilgal, on the eastern edge of Jericho.",
