        "All the kings west of the Jordan heard about what had happened: the kings in the hill country, in the low hills, and all along the coast of the Great Sea as far as Lebanon. They were the kings of the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites.",
        "So they joined together as one to fight against Joshua and Israel.",
