        "The leaders said, “Let them live.” So they became woodcutters and water carriers for the whole congregation, just as the leaders had promised them.",
        "Joshua called for the Gibeonites and asked them, “Why did you trick us by saying you live very far away from us, when you really live right here among us?”",
        "“Now you are under a curse. You will never stop being servants, cutting wood and carrying water for the house of my God.”",
