        "They captured two Midianite commanders, Oreb and Zeeb. They killed Oreb at the rock of Oreb and Zeeb at the winepress of Zeeb. They kept chasing the Midianites, and they brought the heads of Oreb and Zeeb to Gideon on the other side of the Jordan."
