        "Eli’s daughter-in-law, the wife of Phinehas, was pregnant and about to give birth. When she heard that the ark of God had been captured and that her father-in-law and her husband were dead, she bent over and gave birth, because her labor pains suddenly came on her.",
        "As she was dying, the women helping her said, “Don’t be afraid. You have had a son!” But she did not answer or pay any attention.",
