        "Then Boaz said to the elders and to all the people, “You are witnesses today that I have bought from Naomi everything that belonged to Elimelech, Chilion, and Mahlon.”",
        "“I have also taken Ruth the Moabitess, Mahlon’s widow, to be my wife. That way the dead man’s name will be carried on with his land, and his name will not disappear from his family or from his hometown. You are witnesses today.”",
        "All the people at the gate and the elders said, “We are witnesses. May the Lord make the woman who is coming into your home like Rachel and Leah, the two women who built up the family of Israel. May you do well in Ephratah and be famous in Beth-lehem.”",
        "“Through the children the Lord gives you by this young woman, may your family become like the family of Pharez, the son Tamar had with Judah.”",
