        "Samuel said to Saul, “Why have you disturbed me by bringing me up?” Saul answered, “I am in terrible trouble. The Philistines are fighting against me, and God has left me. He doesn’t answer me anymore, either by prophets or by dreams. So I have called you to tell me what to do.”",
