        "But Samuel said, “Then what is this bleating of sheep in my ears, and the mooing of cattle that I hear?”",
        "Saul said, “The people brought them from the Amalekites. They spared the best of the sheep and cattle to sacrifice to the Lord your God, and the rest we have completely destroyed.”",
        "Then Samuel said to Saul, “Stop! Let me tell you what the Lord said to me last night.” Saul said, “Tell me.”",
        "Samuel said, “Even though you were small in your own eyes, didn’t you become the head of the tribes of Israel? The Lord anointed you king over Israel.”",
        "“And the Lord sent you on a mission and said, ‘Go and completely destroy those sinners, the Amalekites. Fight against them until they are wiped out.’”",
