        "So the king told Shimei, “You will not die.” And the king made him a promise with an oath.",
        "Mephibosheth the son of Saul (his grandson) also came down to meet the king. From the day the king left until the day he came back safely, Mephibosheth had not cared for his feet, trimmed his beard, or washed his clothes.",
