        "“I, your servant, had two sons. The two of them got into a fight out in the field, and no one was there to pull them apart. One of them hit the other and killed him.”",
        "“Now the whole family has turned against me, your servant. They say, ‘Hand over the one who killed his brother. We will put him to death to pay for the life of the brother he killed. That way we will get rid of the heir too.’ They would put out the last glowing coal I have left (my one remaining son), and leave my husband with no name and no descendants anywhere on the earth.”",
        "The king told the woman, “Go home, and I will give orders to take care of you.”",
