        "In all Israel no one was praised for his good looks as much as Absalom. From the bottom of his feet to the top of his head, there was nothing wrong with him.",
        "He cut his hair once a year, at the end of each year, because it got too heavy for him. When he cut it, he weighed it, and it weighed two hundred shekels (about five pounds) by the royal standard.",
        "Absalom had three sons and one daughter. His daughter’s name was Tamar, and she was a beautiful woman.",
