        "At that time Rezin king of Syria took Elath back for Syria and drove the Jews out of it. The Syrians moved into Elath, and they still live there today.",
        "So Ahaz sent messengers to Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria with this message: “I am your servant and your son. Come up and rescue me from the king of Syria and the king of Israel, who are attacking me.”",
        "Ahaz took the silver and gold found in the Lord’s temple and in the treasure rooms of the king’s palace, and he sent it as a gift to the king of Assyria.",
        "The king of Assyria agreed to help him. He marched against Damascus and captured it. He carried its people away as prisoners to Kir, and he put Rezin to death.",
        "King Ahaz went to Damascus to meet Tiglath-pileser king of Assyria. While there he saw an altar, and he sent Urijah the priest a drawing of the altar and a detailed plan of how it was made.",
