        "But King Solomon loved many foreign women besides Pharaoh’s daughter: women of the Moabites, Ammonites, Edomites, Zidonians, and Hittites.",
        "They came from the nations the Lord had warned the Israelites about: “You must not marry them, and they must not marry you, because they will surely turn your hearts to follow their gods.” Yet Solomon held tight to these women and loved them.",
        "He had seven hundred wives who were princesses, and three hundred concubines (wives of lower rank). And his wives turned his heart away.",
