        "“The Lord said, ‘Who will lure Ahab into going up to Ramoth-gilead so he will be killed there?’ One said one thing, and another said something else.”",
        "“Then a spirit came forward, stood in front of the Lord, and said, ‘I will lure him.’”",
        "“The Lord asked him, ‘How?’ He said, ‘I will go out and be a lying spirit in the mouths of all his prophets.’ The Lord said, ‘You will lure him, and you will succeed. Go and do it.’”",
