        "When the chariot commanders saw that he was not the king of Israel, they stopped chasing him.",
        "But one soldier shot an arrow at random, and it hit the king of Israel between the pieces of his armor. The king told his chariot driver, “Turn around and get me out of the battle, because I am wounded.”",
