        "They washed the chariot at the pool of Samaria, and the dogs licked up his blood, and the prostitutes bathed there, just as the Lord had said would happen.",
        "Everything else Ahab did, including the ivory palace he built and all the cities he built, is written in the book of the history of the kings of Israel.",
        "So Ahab died and rested with his ancestors, and his son Ahaziah became king after him.",
        "Jehoshaphat son of Asa became king of Judah in the fourth year that Ahab was king of Israel.",
