        "He followed all the ways of his father Asa and never turned away from them. He did what was right in the Lord’s eyes. But the high places (hilltop worship sites) were not taken away, and the people still offered sacrifices and burned incense there.",
        "Jehoshaphat also made peace with the king of Israel.",
        "Everything else Jehoshaphat did, the power he showed, and the wars he fought, is written in the book of the history of the kings of Judah.",
