        "So a horseman rode out to meet Jehu and said, “The king asks, ‘Do you come in peace?’” Jehu answered, “What does peace have to do with you? Get in line behind me.” The watchman reported, “The messenger reached them, but he isn’t coming back.”",
        "So the king sent out a second horseman. He came to them and said, “The king asks, ‘Do you come in peace?’” Jehu answered, “What does peace have to do with you? Get in line behind me.”",
