        "“‘I saw the blood of Naboth and the blood of his sons yesterday,’ says the Lord, ‘and I will pay you back on this very piece of land,’ says the Lord. So pick him up and throw him onto that land, just as the Lord said.”",
        "When Ahaziah king of Judah saw this, he ran away on the road toward the garden house. Jehu chased him and shouted, “Shoot him too, in his chariot!” They shot him on the road up to Gur, near Ibleam. He escaped to Megiddo and died there.",
