        "Because your rage against Me and your proud noise have reached My ears, I will put My hook in your nose and My bit in your mouth. I will turn you around and send you back the way you came.",
        "And this will be a sign for you: This year you will eat what grows by itself, and next year what springs up from that. But in the third year, plant and harvest, plant vineyards and eat their fruit.",
        "The ones from the house of Judah who escape and are left will again put down roots below and bear fruit above.",
        "For a remnant will go out from Jerusalem, and survivors from mount Zion. The zeal of the Lord of Hosts will make this happen.",
