        "Jehu said, “Take them alive.” So his men took them alive and then killed them at the well by the shearing house, forty-two men. He did not leave even one of them alive.",
        "When Jehu left there, he came across Jehonadab son of Rechab, who was coming to meet him. Jehu greeted him and asked, “Are you as loyal to me as I am to you?” Jehonadab answered, “I am.” Jehu said, “If you are, give me your hand.” So he gave him his hand, and Jehu pulled him up into the chariot.",
