        "The people of half of Manasseh’s tribe lived in the land too. Their numbers grew, and they spread from Bashan to Baal-hermon, Senir, and Mount Hermon.",
        "The heads of their families were Epher, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah, and Jahdiel. They were brave, strong warriors, well-known men, and leaders of their families.",
