        "So the God of Israel moved Pul, Assyria’s king, and Tilgath-pilneser, Assyria’s king, to act. He took the Reubenites, the Gadites, and half of Manasseh’s tribe away as captives. He brought them to Halah, Habor, Hara, and the Gozan River, where they still are today."
