        "These are the men who came to David at Ziklag while he was still hiding from Saul son of Kish. They were among the mighty warriors who helped him in battle.",
        "They were archers who could use either their right hand or their left to sling stones and shoot arrows. They were Saul’s own relatives from the tribe of Benjamin.",
        "Ahiezer was their leader, then Joash. Both were sons of Shemaah the Gibeathite. There were also Jeziel and Pelet, Azmaveth’s sons; Berachah; Jehu the Antothite;",
