        "“The temple I am going to build will be great, because our God is greater than all gods.”",
        "“But who can really build a house for Him? Even the heavens, even the highest heavens, cannot hold Him. So who am I to build Him a house? It can only be a place to burn offerings before Him.”",
        "“So send me a man skilled in working with gold, silver, bronze, and iron, and with purple, red, and blue cloth, who also knows how to engrave. He will work with the skilled workers I have here in Judah and Jerusalem, whom my father David provided.”",
