        "It will pay for the showbread (the holy bread set before God), the daily grain offering (KJV: meat offering), and the daily burnt offering. It will pay for the offerings on the Sabbaths, at the new moons, and at the appointed feasts. It will pay for the holy offerings, for the sin offerings that make atonement for Israel, and for all the work of the house of our God.",
        "We priests, Levites, and people have drawn lots to decide which family will bring wood to the house of our God at set times each year. The wood is for burning on the altar of the Lord our God, as the law says.",
        "We promise to bring the first crops from our land and the first fruit of every tree to the house of the Lord every year.",
