        "So the elders of the Jews kept building, and it went well for them because of the prophesying of Haggai the prophet and Zechariah the son of Iddo. They built and finished the house, as the God of Israel commanded and as Cyrus, Darius, and Artaxerxes king of Persia had ordered.",
        "This house was finished on the third day of the month Adar, in the sixth year that Darius was king.",
