        "On that day the book of Moses was read aloud for the people to hear. They found it written there that no Ammonite or Moabite should ever join the congregation of God,",
        "because those nations did not meet the people of Israel with food and water. Instead they paid Balaam to curse Israel. But our God turned the curse into a blessing.",
