        "Then I told the Levites to make themselves pure and to come guard the gates, so the Sabbath day would be kept holy. My God, remember me for this too, and have mercy on me because Your faithful love is so great.",
        "In those days I also saw Jewish men who had married women from Ashdod, Ammon, and Moab.",
        "Half of their children spoke the language of Ashdod or the language of one of the other peoples. They could not speak the Jews’ language.",
        "So I argued with those men and called down curses on them. I hit some of them and pulled out their hair. I made them swear an oath in God’s name. I said, “You must not let your daughters marry their sons, and you must not let their daughters marry your sons or marry you.”",
        "“Isn’t this exactly how Solomon king of Israel sinned? Among all the nations there was no king like him. His God loved him and made him king over all Israel. But even he was led into sin by foreign wives.”",
        "“Should we then listen to you and do all this great evil? Should we break faith with our God by marrying foreign wives?”",
        "One of the sons of Joiada, the son of Eliashib the high priest, had married the daughter of Sanballat the Horonite. So I drove him away from me.",
        "My God, remember them, because they have made the priesthood unclean and broken the covenant of the priests and the Levites.",
        "So I made the people pure from everything foreign. I gave the priests and the Levites their duties, each one his own job.",
