        "Then Moab will be ashamed of Chemosh, just as the people of Israel were ashamed of Beth-el, the place they trusted.",
        "How can you say, “We are warriors, strong men ready for battle”?",
        "Moab is ruined, and its cities have been invaded. Its best young men have gone down to be killed, says the King, whose name is the Lord of Hosts.",
        "Moab’s disaster is coming soon. His trouble is rushing toward him.",
        "Mourn for him, all you who live around him, all who know his name. Say, “Look how the strong scepter is broken, the beautiful staff!”",
        "Come down from your place of honor and sit on dry ground, you daughter living in Dibon. The one who destroys Moab has come against you. He has torn down your fortresses.",
        "You who live in Aroer, stand by the road and watch. Ask the man running away and the woman escaping, “What has happened?”",
        "Moab is put to shame, for it is broken down. Wail and cry out! Announce by the Arnon River that Moab is destroyed.",
        "Judgment has come on the high plain: on Holon, Jahazah, and Mephaath,",
        "on Dibon, Nebo, and Beth-diblathaim,",
