        "For Israel and Judah have not been abandoned by their God, the Lord of Hosts, even though their land was full of sin against the Holy One of Israel.",
        "Run out of Babylon! Each of you, save your life! Don’t be destroyed because of her sin. For this is the time of the Lord’s vengeance. He will pay her back what she deserves.",
        "Babylon was a gold cup in the Lord’s hand that made the whole earth drunk. The nations drank her wine, and so the nations have gone crazy.",
        "Babylon has suddenly fallen and been shattered. Wail for her! Get healing balm for her pain; maybe she can be healed.",
        "We tried to heal Babylon, but she could not be healed. Leave her, and let each of us go to his own country. For her punishment reaches up to heaven and rises as high as the skies.",
        "The Lord has shown that we were in the right. Come, let us tell in Zion what the Lord our God has done.",
        "Polish the arrows! Gather the shields! The Lord has stirred up the spirit of the kings of the Medes, because He plans to destroy Babylon. This is the Lord’s vengeance, vengeance for His temple.",
        "Raise the flag on the walls of Babylon! Make the guard strong, post the watchmen, and set up ambushes! For the Lord has both planned and done what He said against the people who live in Babylon.",
        "You who live by many waters and are rich in treasures, your end has come, the full measure of your greed.",
        "The Lord of Hosts has sworn by Himself: “I will surely fill you with men, as many as locusts, and they will shout in victory over you.”",
        "He made the earth by His power. He set the world in place by His wisdom and stretched out the heavens by His understanding.",
        "When He speaks, the waters in the heavens roar. He makes the clouds rise from the ends of the earth. He makes lightning for the rain and brings the wind out of His storehouses.",
        "Every person is foolish and without knowledge. Every metalworker is put to shame by his carved idol, because his metal image is a lie. There is no breath in them.",
        "They are worthless, things to laugh at. When the time comes to punish them, they will be destroyed.",
        "The One who is Jacob’s portion is not like them, for He is the Maker of all things. Israel is the tribe that belongs to Him. The Lord of Hosts is His name.",
        "You are My war club, My weapon for battle. With you I will smash nations, and with you I will destroy kingdoms.",
        "With you I will smash the horse and its rider. With you I will smash the chariot and its driver.",
        "With you I will smash man and woman. With you I will smash old and young. With you I will smash the young man and the young woman.",
        "With you I will smash the shepherd and his flock. With you I will smash the farmer and his team of oxen. With you I will smash governors and officials.",
        "And right before your eyes I will pay back Babylon and everyone who lives in Chaldea for all the evil they did in Zion, says the Lord.",
        "Look, I am against you, you destroying mountain, says the Lord, you who destroy the whole earth. I will stretch out My hand against you, roll you down from the cliffs, and make you a burned-out mountain.",
        "No one will take a stone from you for a cornerstone or for a foundation, because you will be empty forever, says the Lord.",
        "Raise a flag in the land! Blow the trumpet among the nations! Get the nations ready to fight her. Call the kingdoms of Ararat, Minni, and Ashchenaz against her. Appoint a commander against her. Send up horses like bristling locusts.",
        "Get the nations ready to fight her, with the kings of the Medes, their governors, all their officials, and all the land they rule.",
        "The land shakes and twists in pain, because everything the Lord has planned against Babylon will be carried out: to make the land of Babylon a wasteland where no one lives.",
        "The warriors of Babylon have stopped fighting. They stay inside their forts. Their strength is gone; they have become like women. Her houses are set on fire, and the bars of her gates are broken.",
        "One runner races to meet another, and one messenger to meet another, to tell the king of Babylon that his city has been taken from one end to the other,",
        "that the river crossings have been seized, the reed marshes have been burned, and the soldiers are terrified.",
        "For the Lord of Hosts, the God of Israel, says: The daughter of Babylon is like a threshing floor at the time it is stamped flat. In just a little while, her harvest time will come.",
        "Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon has eaten me up and crushed me. He has left me like an empty jar. He has swallowed me like a monster, filled his belly with my fine foods, and thrown me out.",
        "The people of Zion will say, “May the violence done to me and to my body come on Babylon.” Jerusalem will say, “May my blood be on the people who live in Chaldea.”",
        "So the Lord says: I will defend your cause and take vengeance for you. I will dry up her sea and make her springs run dry.",
        "Babylon will become piles of rubble, a home for jackals, a horror, and something people hiss at, with no one living there.",
        "They will roar together like lions. They will growl like lion cubs.",
