        "Her cities have become a wasteland, a dry land and a desert, a land where no one lives and no human being passes through.",
        "I will punish Bel in Babylon. I will make him spit out what he has swallowed. The nations will no longer stream to him. Even the wall of Babylon will fall.",
        "My people, get out of her! Each of you, save your life from the burning anger of the Lord.",
        "Don’t lose heart or be afraid when you hear the rumors in the land. One rumor will come one year, and another the next year, about violence in the land and ruler fighting against ruler.",
        "So the days are coming when I will punish the carved idols of Babylon. Her whole land will be put to shame, and all her dead will fall inside her.",
