        "In the third year of Cyrus king of Persia, a message was shown to Daniel, who was also named Belteshazzar. The message was true, but the time it was about was a long way off. Daniel understood the message and was given understanding through the vision.",
        "At that time I, Daniel, had been mourning for three whole weeks.",
