        "Then he said to me, “Do not be afraid, Daniel. From the very first day you set your heart on understanding and humbled yourself before your God, your words were heard. I have come because of your words.”",
        "But the prince of the kingdom of Persia stood against me for twenty-one days. Then Michael, one of the chief princes, came to help me, and I stayed there with the kings of Persia.",
        "Now I have come to help you understand what will happen to your people in the last days, because the vision is about a time still far away.",
        "While he was saying these things to me, I bowed my face toward the ground and could not speak.",
