        "They stripped her naked. They took her sons and daughters, and they killed her with the sword. She became a name that women talked about, because judgment was carried out on her.",
        "Her sister Aholibah saw this, but she was even more corrupt in her lust than her sister, and her unfaithfulness was worse than her sister’s.",
        "She longed for the Assyrians, her neighbors, governors and commanders dressed in splendid clothes, horsemen riding on horses, all of them attractive young men.",
        "I saw that she too had made herself unclean. Both of them went the same way.",
        "But she went even further in her unfaithfulness. She saw men carved on the wall, pictures of the Chaldeans painted in bright red,",
        "with belts around their waists and flowing turbans on their heads. All of them looked like officers, like the Babylonians of Chaldea, the land where they were born.",
        "As soon as she saw them, she longed for them and sent messengers to them in Chaldea.",
        "The Babylonians came to her bed of love and made her unclean with their lust. After she was made unclean by them, she turned away from them in disgust.",
        "She openly showed her unfaithfulness and uncovered her nakedness. Then I turned away from her in disgust, just as I had turned away from her sister.",
        "Yet she became more and more unfaithful, remembering the days of her youth, when she acted like a prostitute in the land of Egypt.",
        "She longed for her lovers there, whose bodies were like donkeys’ and whose lust was like that of horses.",
        "So you remembered the shameful ways of your youth, when the Egyptians touched your breasts while you were young.",
        "So, Aholibah, this is what the Lord God says: Look, I will stir up your lovers against you, the ones you turned away from in disgust. I will bring them against you from every side:",
        "the Babylonians and all the Chaldeans, Pekod, Shoa, and Koa, and all the Assyrians with them. They are all attractive young men, governors and commanders, great lords and famous men, all riding on horses.",
        "They will come against you with chariots, wagons, and wheels, and with a crowd of peoples. They will surround you with large and small shields and helmets. I will hand judgment over to them, and they will judge you by their own laws.",
        "I will turn My jealous anger against you, and they will deal with you in fury. They will cut off your nose and your ears, and those of you who are left will die by the sword. They will take your sons and daughters, and whoever is left will be burned up by fire.",
        "They will also strip off your clothes and take your beautiful jewelry.",
        "So I will put an end to your shameful ways and the unfaithfulness you brought from Egypt. You will not look to them with longing or remember Egypt anymore.",
        "For this is what the Lord God says: Look, I am going to hand you over to those you hate, to those you turned away from in disgust.",
        "They will treat you with hatred. They will take everything you worked for and leave you stripped and bare. The shame of your unfaithfulness will be exposed, both your shameful ways and your unfaithfulness.",
        "I will do these things to you because you chased after the nations like a prostitute, and because you made yourself unclean with their idols.",
        "You have followed in your sister’s footsteps, so I will put her cup in your hand.",
        "This is what the Lord God says: You will drink your sister’s cup, a cup that is deep and wide. You will be laughed at and mocked, for the cup holds so much.",
        "You will be filled with drunkenness and sorrow. It is a cup of horror and ruin, the cup of your sister Samaria.",
        "You will drink it and drain it dry. You will smash it to pieces and tear at your own breasts. For I have spoken, says the Lord God.",
        "So this is what the Lord God says: Because you have forgotten Me and thrown Me behind your back, you must also bear the punishment for your shameful ways and your unfaithfulness.",
        "The Lord also said to me, Son of man, will you judge Aholah and Aholibah? Then tell them about the disgusting things they have done.",
        "They have committed adultery, and there is blood on their hands. They have committed adultery with their idols. They have even made the sons they bore to Me pass through the fire as food for their idols.",
        "They have also done this to Me: on that same day they made My sanctuary unclean and dishonored My Sabbaths.",
        "On the same day they killed their children for their idols, they came into My sanctuary and dishonored it. Yes, that is what they did inside My house.",
        "What is more, you sent for men to come from far away. A messenger was sent to them, and they came. For them you bathed, painted your eyes, and put on jewelry.",
        "You sat on a fine couch with a table set in front of it, and on it you put My incense and My oil.",
        "The sound of a carefree crowd was with her. Along with the common people, Sabeans were brought in from the desert. They put bracelets on their wrists and beautiful crowns on their heads.",
        "Then I said about the woman worn out by adulteries, “Will men keep on using her as a prostitute, and she keep on with them?”",
        "And they went to her the way men go to a prostitute. That is how they went to Aholah and Aholibah, those shameless women.",
        "But righteous men will judge them with the punishment for women who commit adultery and women who shed blood, because they are adulteresses, and there is blood on their hands.",
