        "The crowd will stone them and cut them down with their swords. They will kill their sons and daughters and burn down their houses.",
        "So I will put an end to shameful behavior in the land, and all women will be warned not to act as shamefully as you did.",
        "They will pay you back for your shameful behavior, and you will suffer for your sins with idols. Then you will know that I am the Lord God."
