        "The high priest stood up and said to Him, “Aren’t You going to answer? What is this that these men are saying against You?”",
        "But Jesus stayed silent. The high priest said to Him, “I command You under oath by the living God: tell us whether You are the Christ, the Son of God.”",
        "Jesus said to him, “You have said it. But I tell you all, from now on you will see the Son of Man sitting at the right hand of power and coming on the clouds of heaven.”",
        "Then the high priest tore his clothes and said, “He has spoken blasphemy! Why do we need any more witnesses? Look, now you have heard His blasphemy.”",
        "“What do you think?” They answered, “He deserves to die.”",
        "Then they spat in His face and hit Him with their fists. Others slapped Him",
