        "“A Levite (a man who served at the temple) did the same. He came to that place and looked at him, and then went past on the other side.”",
        "“But a Samaritan who was on a journey came to where the man was. When he saw him, he felt compassion for him.”",
        "“He went to him and bandaged his wounds, pouring oil and wine on them. Then he put him on his own animal, brought him to an inn, and took care of him.”",
        "“The next day, as he was leaving, he took out two pence (two silver coins, each worth a day’s pay) and gave them to the innkeeper. He told him, ‘Take care of him. If you spend any more than this, I will pay you back when I return.’”",
        "“Which of these three men do you think was a neighbor to the man who was attacked by robbers?”",
        "The man said, “The one who showed him mercy.” Then Jesus said to him, “Go and do the same.”",
