        "“Don’t be afraid, little flock. It makes your Father happy to give you the kingdom.”",
        "“Sell what you own and give to the poor. Get yourselves money bags that don’t wear out, a treasure in heaven that never runs out, where no thief comes near and no moth ruins anything.”",
        "“Wherever your treasure is, that is where your heart will be too.”",
        "“Be dressed and ready for work, with your robes tucked up, and keep your lamps burning.”",
        "“Be like servants waiting for their master to come home from the wedding, so that when he comes and knocks, they can open the door for him right away.”",
        "“Those servants are blessed whom the master finds awake and watching when he comes. I tell you the truth, he will get dressed to serve, have them sit down to eat, and come and serve them himself.”",
        "“Even if he comes in the second watch or the third watch of the night (late at night) and finds them ready, those servants are blessed.”",
        "“But understand this: if the owner of the house had known what hour the thief was coming, he would have stayed awake and not let his house be broken into.”",
        "“So you must be ready too, because the Son of Man is coming at an hour when you don’t expect Him.”",
        "Then Peter said to Him, “Lord, are You telling this parable just to us, or to everyone?”",
        "The Lord said, “Who then is the faithful and wise steward (manager) whom his master will put in charge of his household, to give them their share of food at the right time?”",
        "“That servant is blessed whom his master finds doing this when he comes.”",
        "“I tell you the truth, he will put him in charge of everything he owns.”",
        "“But suppose that servant says to himself, ‘My master is taking a long time to come,’ and begins to beat the other men and women servants, and to eat and drink and get drunk.”",
        "“The master of that servant will come on a day when he isn’t looking for him and at an hour he doesn’t know. He will cut him in pieces and give him his place with the unbelievers.”",
        "“That servant who knew what his master wanted, but did not get ready or do what his master wanted, will be beaten with many lashes.”",
        "“But the one who did not know, and did things that deserved a beating, will be beaten with few lashes. From everyone who has been given much, much will be required. And from the one people have trusted with much, they will ask even more.”",
        "“I have come to send fire on the earth, and how I wish it were already burning!”",
        "“But I have a baptism to be baptized with, and how pressed and troubled I am until it is finished!”",
        "“Do you think I came to bring peace on earth? No, I tell you, I came to bring division instead.”",
        "“From now on, five people in one house will be divided, three against two and two against three.”",
        "“A father will be divided against his son, and a son against his father. A mother will be against her daughter, and a daughter against her mother. A mother-in-law will be against her daughter-in-law, and a daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law.”",
        "He also said to the crowds, “When you see a cloud coming up in the west, you say right away, ‘A rainstorm is coming,’ and it does.”",
        "“And when you feel the south wind blowing, you say, ‘It is going to be hot,’ and it is.”",
        "“You hypocrites! You know how to read the look of the sky and the earth. So why can’t you read the time you are living in now?”",
        "“And why don’t you decide for yourselves what is right?”",
        "“When you are on your way to the official with the person who has a case against you, try hard to settle with him on the way. Otherwise he may drag you to the judge, and the judge will hand you over to the officer, and the officer will throw you into prison.”",
        "“I tell you, you won’t get out of there until you have paid the very last mite (the smallest coin).”"
