        "But He answered them, “My mother and My brothers are those who hear the word of God and obey it.”",
        "One day He got into a boat with His disciples and said to them, “Let’s cross over to the other side of the lake.” So they set out.",
        "As they sailed, He fell asleep. A windstorm came down on the lake. The boat was filling with water, and they were in danger.",
        "The disciples came and woke Him up, saying, “Master, Master, we are going to die!” He got up and ordered the wind and the raging water to stop. They stopped, and everything was calm.",
        "He asked them, “Where is your faith?” They were afraid and amazed, and they said to each other, “What kind of man is this? He gives orders even to the winds and the water, and they obey Him!”",
        "They landed in the land of the Gadarenes, which is across the lake from Galilee.",
