        "“He is staying with Simon, a tanner, whose house is by the sea. He will tell you what you need to do.”",
        "When the angel who spoke to Cornelius had left, Cornelius called two of his household servants and a devout soldier who was one of his personal attendants.",
        "He told them everything that had happened and sent them to Joppa.",
        "The next day, as they were on their way and getting close to the city, Peter went up on the flat roof of the house to pray. It was about noon.",
