        "“So get up, go downstairs, and go with them. Don’t doubt at all, because I have sent them.”",
        "So Peter went down to the men Cornelius had sent and said, “I am the man you are looking for. Why have you come?”",
        "They said, “Cornelius the centurion sent us. He is a good man who fears God, and all the Jewish people speak well of him. God told him through a holy angel to invite you to his house so he could hear what you have to say.”",
        "So Peter invited them in to stay as his guests. The next day Peter left with them, and some of the brothers from Joppa went along.",
