        "He said to them, “You know that it is against our law for a Jew to spend time with someone from another nation or visit him. But God has shown me that I should not call any person impure or unclean.”",
        "“That is why I came without arguing as soon as I was sent for. So I ask, why did you send for me?”",
        "Cornelius answered: Four days ago I was fasting until this time of day. At the ninth hour (three in the afternoon) I was praying in my house, and suddenly a man in shining clothes stood in front of me.",
        "He said, “Cornelius, your prayer has been heard, and God has remembered your gifts to the poor.”",
        "“So send to Joppa and ask Simon, also called Peter, to come here. He is staying at the house of Simon, a tanner, by the sea. When he comes, he will speak to you.”",
        "So I sent for you right away, and it was good of you to come. Now we are all here before God, ready to hear everything God has commanded you to say.",
        "Then Peter began to speak: Now I truly understand that God does not play favorites.",
        "In every nation, anyone who fears Him and does what is right is accepted by Him.",
        "This is the message God sent to the children of Israel, preaching peace through Jesus Christ. (He is Lord of all.)",
        "You know that message yourselves. It spread through all of Judæa, starting in Galilee after the baptism John preached.",
        "You know how God anointed Jesus of Nazareth with the Holy Ghost and with power, and how He went around doing good and healing everyone the devil was oppressing, because God was with Him.",
        "We are witnesses of everything He did in the land of the Jews and in Jerusalem. They killed Him by hanging Him on a tree (the cross).",
