        "When they came to him, he said to them, “You know how I lived the whole time I was with you, from the first day I came into Asia.”",
        "“I served the Lord with all humility, with many tears, and through the trials that came to me because of the plots of the Jews.”",
        "“You know I didn’t hold back anything that would help you. I told you and taught you in public and from house to house.”",
        "“I testified to both Jews and Greeks that they must repent and turn to God, and have faith in our Lord Jesus Christ.”",
        "“And now I am going to Jerusalem, bound in the spirit, not knowing what will happen to me there,”",
        "“except that the Holy Ghost tells me in every city that chains and suffering are waiting for me.”",
        "“But none of these things stop me, and I don’t count my life as precious to me, as long as I can finish my race with joy, and finish the work the Lord Jesus gave me: to testify of the gospel of the grace of God.”",
        "“And now I know that none of you, among whom I went about preaching the kingdom of God, will ever see my face again.”",
        "“So I declare to you today that I am innocent of the blood of all people.”",
        "“For I didn’t hold back from telling you the whole plan of God.”",
        "“So watch over yourselves and over the whole flock that the Holy Ghost has made you overseers of. Shepherd the church of God, which He bought with His own blood.”",
        "“For I know that after I leave, fierce wolves will come in among you and will not spare the flock.”",
        "“Even from among your own group, men will rise up and twist the truth to pull disciples away to follow them.”",
        "“So stay alert, and remember that for three years I never stopped warning each of you, night and day, with tears.”",
        "“And now, brothers, I trust you to God and to the word of His grace. It can build you up and give you an inheritance among all who are sanctified (made holy).”",
