        "My brothers and sisters, think of it as pure joy when you run into all kinds of trials.",
        "You know that when your faith is tested, it builds patience that lasts.",
        "Let patience finish its full work in you, so that you may be perfect and whole, not missing anything.",
        "If any of you needs wisdom, ask God for it. He gives freely to everyone and does not scold you for asking, and it will be given to you.",
        "But you must ask in faith, without doubting at all. Someone who doubts is like a wave of the sea, pushed and thrown around by the wind.",
        "That person should not expect to get anything from the Lord.",
        "A person who can’t make up his mind is unsteady in everything he does.",
        "The brother who has little should be glad that he is lifted up high.",
        "And the rich brother should be glad when he is brought low, because like a wildflower he will fade away.",
        "The sun comes up with its burning heat and dries up the grass. Its flower drops off, and its beauty is gone. In the same way, the rich man will fade away while he is busy with his plans.",
        "Blessed is the person who holds up under trials. When he has passed the test, he will receive the crown of life, which the Lord has promised to those who love Him.",
        "When you are tempted, don’t say, “God is tempting me.” God cannot be tempted by evil, and He does not tempt anyone.",
        "Instead, each person is tempted when his own wrong desires pull him away and lure him in.",
        "Then, once that desire has taken root, it gives birth to sin. And when sin is fully grown, it gives birth to death.",
