        "Every good and perfect gift comes from above. It comes down from the Father of lights, who never changes and never shifts like a moving shadow.",
        "He chose to give us new life through the word of truth, so that we would be a kind of firstfruits (the first part of the harvest) of all He created.",
        "So, my dear brothers and sisters, everyone should be quick to listen, slow to speak, and slow to get angry.",
        "A person’s anger does not bring about the righteousness God wants.",
        "So get rid of everything dirty and all the evil that overflows, and humbly accept the word planted in you, which has the power to save your souls.",
        "Do what the word says. Don’t just listen to it, or you are fooling yourselves.",
        "Anyone who hears the word but doesn’t do it is like a man who looks at his own face in a mirror.",
        "He looks at himself, walks away, and right away forgets what he looks like.",
